44. FINAL EXPERIENCE GOAL

The final experience should make an employee feel:

«"This is my work cockpit."»

And make an owner/manager feel:

«"This is my agency's workforce command center."»

The employee should be able to understand their entire day from Workspace within 10 seconds.

The manager should be able to understand an employee's performance within 30 seconds.

The system should make it possible to move from:

Metric → Employee → Work → CRM Record → Action

with minimal clicks.

Prioritize usability and operational efficiency over visual decoration.

Create a polished, realistic, production-ready SaaS interface rather than a conceptual dashboard mockup. 
